<article class="case-document">
  {{> branding}}
  <section><h2>Justification</h2><div class="description-text">{{justification}}</div></section>
  <section><h2>Report basis</h2>
    {{#reportId}}<p>Report {{reportId}}. The report snapshot retains the scenario entries, forecast inputs, calculation workings and presentation settings used for this document. Reported alternatives must be copied before editing.</p>{{/reportId}}
    <p>Outcomes show the net change from the separate posted Applied contribution, including dependent entries. Shared history and forecast movements are excluded from these incremental tables.</p>
    {{#context}}<p>{{name}}: {{scenario}}. {{selected}}.{{#budget}} Source budget: {{budget}}.{{/budget}}{{#start}} Coverage: {{start}}–{{end}}; actuals through {{cutoff}}.{{/start}}{{#hash}} Source fingerprint: {{hash}}.{{/hash}}</p>{{/context}}
    {{#contextMissing}}<p>No companion forecast or case is included in this report context.</p>{{/contextMissing}}
  </section>
  <section><h2>Alternatives considered</h2>
    <p><em>Table {{alternativesTable}}</em> identifies the alternatives. The separate Applied scenario records the contribution already in the baseline; it is not an alternative.</p>
    {{#summary}}<p>{{name}} is selected, with status {{status}}. {{^empty}}<em>Table {{table}}</em> shows its incremental account impact.{{/empty}}{{#empty}}No change to the Applied contribution.{{/empty}}</p>{{/summary}}
    {{^summary}}<p>No scenario is selected. The alternatives are compared with the Applied contribution.</p>{{/summary}}
    {{#scenarios}}<h2>{{name}}</h2><div class="description-text">{{description}}</div><p>Health: {{health}}. Transactions use the {{level}} presentation.</p>{{#findings}}<p>{{text}} {{entry}}</p>{{/findings}}{{/scenarios}}
    {{#outcomes}}<p>{{name}}: {{status}}.{{#empty}} No change to the Applied contribution.{{/empty}}{{^empty}} <em>Table {{table}}</em> gives its supporting outcome.{{/empty}} Health: {{health}}.</p>{{/outcomes}}
    {{#tables}}<p><em>Table {{number}}</em> contains the complete {{level}} transactions for {{name}}.</p>{{/tables}}
    {{#figures}}<p><em>Figure {{number}}</em> groups the selected account movements for {{name}}.</p>{{/figures}}
  </section>
  <section class="report-tables">
    <p class="report-caption">Table {{alternativesTable}} Scenarios</p><table><thead><tr><th>Scenario</th><th>Status</th><th>Entries</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#alternatives}}<tr><td>{{name}}</td><td>{{status}}</td><td class="event-number">{{entryCount}}</td></tr>{{/alternatives}}</tbody></table>
    {{#summary}}{{> outcome}}{{/summary}}
    {{#scenarios}}{{> transactions}}{{/scenarios}}
    {{#outcomes}}{{> outcome}}{{/outcomes}}
  </section>
</article>
